@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
<http://example.org/Student> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/Person> .
<http://example.org/Professor> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/Person> .
<http://example.org/Professor> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/Academic> .
<http://example.org/Animal> <http://example.org/ont/name> "Animal" .
<http://example.org/Person> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/LivingThing> .
